@backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5293
@accessToken =
@refreshToken =

### 1. Đăng ký
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "hoang_test",
  "email": "hoang_test@example.com",
  "password": "Hoang@123456",
  "fullName": "Hoàng Test",
  "phone": "0912345678",
  "address": "Hà Nội"
}

### 2. Đăng nhập (copy accessToken/refreshToken vào biến trên)
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "hoang_test",
  "password": "Hoang@123456"
}

### 3. Làm mới token
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 4. Xem hồ sơ cá nhân
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 5. Cập nhật hồ sơ
PUT {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Hoàng Updated",
  "phone": "0987654321",
  "address": "TP.HCM"
}

### 6. Đổi mật khẩu
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/users/me/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "Hoang@123456",
  "newPassword": "Hoang@654321"
}

### 7. Xác thực email (dán token từ log EmailService)
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "PASTE_TOKEN_HERE"
}

### 8. Quên mật khẩu
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "hoang_test@example.com"
}

### 9. Đặt lại mật khẩu (dán token từ log EmailService)
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "PASTE_TOKEN_HERE",
  "newPassword": "Hoang@123456"
}

### 10. Đăng xuất
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 11. Admin: danh sách người dùng
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/users?search=hoang&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 12. Admin: khóa/mở khóa (dán userId)
PUT {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/users/PASTE_USER_ID/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}
